    "note": "Mega Raichu Y levitates and bounces: the game's own battle idle for this form (pm0026_52_00_10001_battlewait01_loop from the user's Legends Z-A pack) drives everything: legs dangling, one big airborne bounce per loop, arms pumping, head and ear tufts bobbing. Moved onto the textured body copy (MegaRaichuY/MegaRaichuY_clip.blend) with no offset or scale. Added on top (gen.py): a tail whip, because in the clip the bolt barely moves: an in-picture swing (ROLLCAM) down the cord and bolt, each joint a beat later than the one before, the bolt with a 2x flutter. Game speed: frames 1-81 at 60 fps = 1.333 s; 44 frames x 30 ms = 1.320 s (1% fast), seamless loop."
